{"id":"13fcf2998466e976","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-locale-points-prime-elements.md","title":"Theorem — locale 点与真素元的显式互逆","display":"Theorem — locale 点与真素元的显式互逆","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-locale-points-prime-elements","aliases":["14-thm-locale-points-prime-elements"],"display":"Theorem — locale 点与真素元的显式互逆","depends_on":["[[14-df-frame]]","[[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]]","[[14-thm-locale-topos-point-correspondence]]","[[14-df-locale-point-space]]"],"source_location":"IX.2 Lemma 1, printed 474–475; DjVu 243","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-locale-points-prime-elements"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-locale-points-prime-elements</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — locale 点与真素元的显式互逆"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"382a1dd68ab6f77b\" href=\"?note=382a1dd68ab6f77b\" title=\"14-df-frame\">14-df-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f8d75439f8e94de\" href=\"?note=2f8d75439f8e94de\" title=\"14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale\">14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"288974bbe429c3b2\" href=\"?note=288974bbe429c3b2\" title=\"14-thm-locale-topos-point-correspondence\">14-thm-locale-topos-point-correspondence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"39a135f8028fddc1\" href=\"?note=39a135f8028fddc1\" title=\"14-df-locale-point-space\">14-df-locale-point-space</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"IX.2 Lemma 1, printed 474–475; DjVu 243"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为小框架，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pt}(L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Pt}(L)\\)</span> 为到 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"39a135f8028fddc1\" href=\"?note=39a135f8028fddc1\" title=\"14-df-locale-point-space\">14-df-locale-point-space</a> 标准两元素框架的同态集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in|L|\">\\(p\\in|L|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\operatorname{Pt}(L)\">\\(h\\in\\operatorname{Pt}(L)\\)</span>；所有下确界和序使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的结构。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\downarrow_L p\">\\(\\downarrow_L p\\)</span> 为下式定义的主下闭集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\downarrow_L p:=\\{a\\in|L|\\mid a\\le p\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PPrime}_L(p)\\leftrightarrow p\\ne\\top_L\\land\\forall a,b\\in|L|\\ (a\\wedge b\\le p\\Rightarrow a\\le p\\lor b\\le p),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pr}(L):=\\{p\\in|L|\\mid\\operatorname{PPrime}_L(p)\\},\\quad\nK_L(h):=\\{a\\in|L|\\mid h(a)=0\\},\\quad q_L(h):=\\bigvee K_L(h),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PPrime}_L(q_L(h)),\\qquad K_L(h)=\\downarrow_L q_L(h),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PPrime}_L(p)\\Rightarrow\n\\left(h_p:|L|\\to\\{0,1\\},\\quad h_p(a):=\\begin{cases}0&amp;a\\le p,\\\\1&amp;a\\not\\le p\\end{cases},\\quad h_p\\in\\operatorname{Pt}(L)\\right),\\\\\nq_L:\\operatorname{Pt}(L)\\to\\operatorname{Pr}(L),\\quad\n\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Pt}(L)\\ h_{q_L(h)}=h,\\quad\n\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{Pr}(L)\\ q_L(h_p)=p.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\downarrow_L p:=\\{a\\in|L|\\mid a\\le p\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PPrime}_L(p)\\leftrightarrow p\\ne\\top_L\\land\\forall a,b\\in|L|\\ (a\\wedge b\\le p\\Rightarrow a\\le p\\lor b\\le p),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pr}(L):=\\{p\\in|L|\\mid\\operatorname{PPrime}_L(p)\\},\\quad\nK_L(h):=\\{a\\in|L|\\mid h(a)=0\\},\\quad q_L(h):=\\bigvee K_L(h),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PPrime}_L(q_L(h)),\\qquad K_L(h)=\\downarrow_L q_L(h),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PPrime}_L(p)\\Rightarrow\n\\left(h_p:|L|\\to\\{0,1\\},\\quad h_p(a):=\\begin{cases}0&amp;a\\le p,\\\\1&amp;a\\not\\le p\\end{cases},\\quad h_p\\in\\operatorname{Pt}(L)\\right),\\\\\nq_L:\\operatorname{Pt}(L)\\to\\operatorname{Pr}(L),\\quad\n\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Pt}(L)\\ h_{q_L(h)}=h,\\quad\n\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{Pr}(L)\\ q_L(h_p)=p.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 的零逆像对任意并封闭，故其并仍映到0，并且零逆像恰为该并的下闭集；保持顶保证该并不为顶。二元交映到0当且仅当至少一项映到0，给真素性。反向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_p\">\\(h_p\\)</span> 保持顶和二元交；任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee A\\le p\">\\(\\bigvee A\\le p\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的每项都不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，给任意并保持，包含空并。下闭集的并为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，故两个构造严格互逆。本条补的是原书真素元表示，不重复<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d8b0dff1fbe3e5a5\" href=\"?note=d8b0dff1fbe3e5a5\" title=\"14-df-completely-prime-filters-and-locale-points\">14-df-completely-prime-filters-and-locale-points</a>的完全素滤子定义；二者分别使用点的零逆像与一逆像。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-frame","status":"resolved","id":"382a1dd68ab6f77b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale","status":"resolved","id":"2f8d75439f8e94de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-locale-topos-point-correspondence","status":"resolved","id":"288974bbe429c3b2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-locale-topos-point-correspondence]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-locale-point-space","status":"resolved","id":"39a135f8028fddc1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-locale-point-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-locale-point-space","status":"resolved","id":"39a135f8028fddc1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为小框架，$\\operatorname{Pt}(L)$ 为到 [[14-df-locale-point-space]] 标准两元素框架的同态集合。$p\\in|L|$、$h\\in\\operatorname{Pt}(L)$；所有下确界和序使用 $L$ 的结构。$\\downarrow_L p$ 为下式定义的主下闭集。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-completely-prime-filters-and-locale-points","status":"resolved","id":"d8b0dff1fbe3e5a5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$h$ 的零逆像对任意并封闭，故其并仍映到0，并且零逆像恰为该并的下闭集；保持顶保证该并不为顶。二元交映到0当且仅当至少一项映到0，给真素性。反向 $h_p$ 保持顶和二元交；任意 $A$ 满足 $\\bigvee A\\le p$ 当且仅当 $A$ 的每项都不超过 $p$，给任意并保持，包含空并。下闭集的并为 $p$，故两个构造严格互逆。本条补的是原书真素元表示，不重复[[14-df-completely-prime-filters-and-locale-points]]的完全素滤子定义；二者分别使用点的零逆像与一逆像。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pt}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in|L|","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\operatorname{Pt}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\downarrow_L p","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\downarrow_L p:=\\{a\\in|L|\\mid a\\le p\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{PPrime}_L(p)\\leftrightarrow p\\ne\\top_L\\land\\forall a,b\\in|L|\\ (a\\wedge b\\le p\\Rightarrow a\\le p\\lor b\\le p),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pr}(L):=\\{p\\in|L|\\mid\\operatorname{PPrime}_L(p)\\},\\quad\nK_L(h):=\\{a\\in|L|\\mid h(a)=0\\},\\quad q_L(h):=\\bigvee K_L(h),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PPrime}_L(q_L(h)),\\qquad K_L(h)=\\downarrow_L q_L(h),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PPrime}_L(p)\\Rightarrow\n\\left(h_p:|L|\\to\\{0,1\\},\\quad h_p(a):=\\begin{cases}0&a\\le p,\\\\1&a\\not\\le p\\end{cases},\\quad h_p\\in\\operatorname{Pt}(L)\\right),\\\\\nq_L:\\operatorname{Pt}(L)\\to\\operatorname{Pr}(L),\\quad\n\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Pt}(L)\\ h_{q_L(h)}=h,\\quad\n\\forall p\\in\\operatorname{Pr}(L)\\ q_L(h_p)=p.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"h_p","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigvee A\\le p","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":2257,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-271","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-locale-points-prime-elements|Theorem — locale 点与真素元的显式互逆]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-locale-points-prime-elements]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-288","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-locale-points-prime-elements]]"},{"id":"6bb5b9d57a0fd21c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-locale-points-prime-elements]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-210","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-locale-points-prime-elements]]"},{"id":"1da7e2c457d58e6f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"利用[[14-thm-locale-points-prime-elements]]，余有限开集框架的真素元恰为 $\\varnothing$ 与 $\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{n\\}$：若补集含两个不同点，可取分别去掉它们的开集，使其交落在给定开集内，但各自都不落在其中，违背素性。空开集因非空开集必相交而为素元；补单点由求值给出。于是全部点恰为实际点与额外的 $\\gamma$。对每个 $n$，$\\gamma(\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{n\\})=1$ 而 $e_{\\mathbb C}(n)$ 在该开集值为0，所以额外点确实不同。余有限例为本地重构的反例，没有冒称479页直接陈述此例。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-272","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-locale-points-prime-elements|Theorem — locale 点与真素元的显式互逆]]"},{"id":"f863f2fcbeac24d8","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"先由[[14-thm-locale-points-prime-elements]]把点识别为真素开集；对空间的开集框架，真素开集的补集正是非空不可约闭集。求值点 $e_T(x)$ 的零核之并是 $X\\setminus\\operatorname{cl}_T\\{x\\}$，故 $T$ sober 当且仅当 $e_T$ 双射。[[14-thm-space-locale-adjunction]]的逆像公式又说明此双射为开映射，因此为同胚。"}],"outgoing":["382a1dd68ab6f77b","2f8d75439f8e94de","288974bbe429c3b2","39a135f8028fddc1","d8b0dff1fbe3e5a5"]}